        <p>TN THESE DAYS Or BIG STATEUE NTS IN oftentimes as vague as incredible, omauating from firms each vieing with tbe others as to who shall persuade) the public that they and they only are enjoying nnprere- dented prosperity, It is a pleasure to encounter an old- established house who, entirely avoiding all maire-tselieva and dissimulation, fearlessly publish a frank statement of figures, c-rtified by a well-known firm of accountants, reveal- ing the exult position of attain), as follows :- 13, Spring Gardens, Manchester. January 5, 1900. Dear sir,—We beg to certify that according to the monthly totals, as shown in your sales books, the INCURASE IN YOUR TURNOVER for the year 1839 over that of 1893 amounts to £7,403 is, 7d. Yours respr-ctfully, W. DOLTON, AND CO., Chartered Accountants. To r. Samuel Pitts, London-road, Manchester.</p>
        <p>PITTS'S BELIEVE COMMENT ON TIIM ABOVE UNNECEiS4.IIY, except to remark that this VAST INORBAS., in 1399 was precoled by a similar one in 1893, and present indications point to a still larger increase during 190. Ityidently the public are thoroughly convinced that to obtain BEST Slid:cnom and UTIIOST•VAL OE it Is an absolutely essential to paronise PITTi'S THE RE- NOWNED GENERAL FUitNISIIhRS. Established Fifty- five Years.</p>
        <p>r-)ITTS'S.-CELEBRATED HOUSES OF FURNI- TUTLE at 15f, 22}, 28i, 34, 60, 75, 100, 200, up to 1,000 guineas, excite wonder and admiration ha all beboldets. THEY STAND UNRIVALLED. They are a source of pride and delight to FLITS'S countless customers, and of despair to would-be competitors. Everyone astounded at the quantity and quality of the articles. All desirous of possesslug a happy home, comfortably, artistically, and ecocornically tsar- nished, should send for full particulars. Cash priaes only quoted. Deforred paymnts arranAed suiting convenience.</p>
        <p>PITTS'S NEW ILLUSTRATED FURNISHING GUIDE, is universally rmcognised as the handsomest and most cornprehentive extant. It contains 700 extremely artistic designs, priced, and shows 'nearly how to SAVE FIFTY PER CENT. Post free.</p>
        <p>PITTS'S CARPETS AND FLOOR COVERINGS. All British make. Fitted free. Largest, best, aad cheapest stoek. Astounding value. Grand display.</p>
        <p>pITTS'S BKDSTKAD DISPLAY in Show Win- dows. 250 feet long, eclipses all others. Previous to the Bedstead Manufacturers' Asscciation's great advances PITTS'S plazed contracts for £l,OOO Bedsteads. consequently PITTS'S customers are now getting the ben.-fit of this bold stroke.</p>
        <p>DITTS'S PIANOS.—NEW INSTRUMENTS guar- i Yuuts, by Co:lard, Brinsmead.Kirkman. ad TI and many Other renowned makers, at c,n- Eirardr "teKe sideralily UNDER. usual prices. SECOND-HAND INSTRU- It NNTs, splendid selection, some of which cost double and treble. Cash prices only quoted. Deferred payments Delivered first instalment.</p>
