        <p>The following were tht7results of the matches chosen for Football Competition No 26 :—Bolten Wanderers beat Wool- wich A, Newton Heath beat New Brighton, Middleborough drew with Luton. Barnsley beat Qaiusborough T. Bursiem Pori Vale beat Walsall. Beading beat Bristol City, Bed- minster beat New Brompton, Swinton beat Sheppy South b.at North, Leeds beat Brighouse. The following Competitors gave ten correct results and therefore share the £5O prize : Mr It Maple, Oaklands, Bushmead Avenue, Bedford, Mr J T Hughes, 11. Wilton-road, Bexhill. Mr II Proctor. 6. Spring Vale, Haslingden, Lane.. Mr A Arthur, 6. York-road, Tunbridge Wells (3 shares). Mr H Beckett. Fouuttin Hotel, Sittinghourne. Mr H B Pittam, 72, Fore-street, London. Mr G T Shaw, liorsmonden, Kent. FOUR LOCAL WINNERS. _ .</p>
