        <p>with a slight advantage it) favour of Runcorn, if any- thing. S. Helen 3 again breaking away Houghton hid another warm handful to deal witb,and only just kicked over in time. The final then came with St. Helens, 1 try, 3 points ; Runcorn, 1 goal, 2 points.</p>
