        <p>was plAyeci at Itoctldt!e. Ii the first half capital tries were scored for the home team. by Jtckson, Hickey, and Ellis, but no goals resut id. Half-time: —Hornets, three trios ; Warriaetoa, uji. T ) wards toe finish Vaughan scored a grand try at the corner. Final :—Rochdale Hornets, four tries ; Warrington, nil.</p>
