        <p>OI3IOICHTBRS will be glad to:know that GM G.BITSSSY AND Co.'s Catalogue is out and may be obtained from Sports Dealers. This Manufacturing;Firm is always beat =improve- ments. Their New Compound Bad " POLLOID " is the most Perfect resemblance to the leather Match Bali that has been produced costing under half the price. For Leading Clubs GG B &amp; Co.'s " Duplex Cover" reigns paramount over all Cricket Balls.—Advt. (2.)</p>
