        <p>NOTICE TO CORRESPONDENT. Authors of letters intended for publication must in al cases Km: their names and addresises to the Editor. Matters lorendcd for publicaion must be written on tme side only of the paper. Correspondents are strongly adviefd to write hyiefly. A short letter has much greater chance of insertion than a long one.</p>
